<p class="MsoNormal">Dear Debra<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Thanks for your email below. Alison has passed your email to me.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">In answer to your query, it is my understanding that as your organisation has a building located on Harlow College land and we have a safeguarding duty of care, Harlow College and BMAT STEM share DBS information on their staffing, to satisfy
