 and not share it. <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">In terms of GDPR requirements, this arrangement is explained to our staff in our privacy statement. &nbsp;Our Data Protection Officer is happy with this arrangement.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">I hope this answers your query. <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
